SET
  @Name_8ca52269f234 = N'MJ: Record Processes'
SET
  @Description_8ca52269f234 = N'A declarative, reusable job definition that binds three axes of a business process: WORK (an Action or an Agent) x SCOPE (a single record, a User View, a List, or an ad-hoc Filter) x TRIGGER (on-change save hooks, a cron schedule, and/or on demand). One row is one configured process; each execution of it produces a Process Run with per-record Process Run Details. EXAMPLE: a "Weekly Customer Health Summary" row runs the "Customer Summarizer" agent over the "Active Customers" view every Saturday 2am, also whenever a customer''s NPS/support fields change, and on demand; for each customer it infers {satisfaction, sentiment, personalityStyle, summary} and writes satisfaction/sentiment back onto the Customer plus a summary into a Customer Insights child row, skipping customers unchanged since the last run.'
