SET
  @Name_1fca84ead971 = N'MJ: Process Runs'
SET
  @Description_1fca84ead971 = N'Source-agnostic header for one execution of any set-processing job. Deliberately generic: a Record Process run sets RecordProcessID, but legacy/engine-driven jobs (e.g., a geocoding sweep or vector sync) keep their own source tables and still record a run here with RecordProcessID = NULL, giving every batch a uniform audit + resume trail. EXAMPLE: the Saturday 2am run of "Weekly Customer Health Summary" over 1,284 active customers (RecordProcessID set, TriggeredBy=Schedule); or a nightly geocoding sweep (RecordProcessID NULL).'
